sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Officer as PSU Officer
    actor Vendor as Disqualified / Competitor Vendor
    actor CVC as CVC Vigilance Officer
    participant Backend as Backend Relay Server
    participant SmartContract as OilTenderingV1 (Proxy)
    participant Keeper as Autonomous Keeper
    participant Treasury as CVC / Govt Treasury

    Note over Officer,SmartContract: Phase 1: Technical Scoring & On-Chain L1 Award
    Officer->>Backend: POST /api/tenders/:id/tech-score (Bearer JWT, scores)
    Backend->>Backend: Verify Officer PSU Tenancy Matches Tender PSU
    Backend->>SmartContract: eth_sendTransaction: setTechnicalScore(tenderId, bidIndex, isQualified, score)
    SmartContract-->>Backend: Emit TechnicalScoreUpdated
    Note over SmartContract: Reveal Deadline Passes (now > revealDeadline)
    Officer->>Backend: POST /api/tenders/:id/award (Bearer JWT, winner, bidId, amount)
    Backend->>Backend: Verify Officer PSU Tenancy
    Backend->>SmartContract: eth_sendTransaction: awardTender(tenderId, winner, bidId, amount)
    SmartContract->>SmartContract: Reject any unrevealed bids (forfeit EMD)
    SmartContract->>SmartContract: On-Chain L1 Check: Assert winner == lowestQualifiedVendor && amount == lowestQualifiedAmount
    SmartContract->>SmartContract: Transition status = Awarded; record awardTimestamp = now
    SmartContract-->>Backend: Emit TenderAwarded(tenderId, winner, winningBidAmount)

    Note over Vendor,SmartContract: Phase 2: Standstill Period (7 Days) & Grievance Lodging
    alt Vendor Files Grievance within 7 Days
        Vendor->>SmartContract: eth_sendTransaction: disputeTender(tenderId, reasonCid) {value: 0.01 ETH Bond}
        SmartContract->>SmartContract: Verify: caller is bidder, now <= awardTimestamp + 7 days, value >= disputeBond
        SmartContract->>SmartContract: Transition status = Disputed; append Dispute record
        SmartContract-->>Vendor: Emit TenderDisputed(tenderId, vendor, bondAmount)

        Note over CVC,SmartContract: Phase 3A: CVC Vigilance Adjudication
        CVC->>SmartContract: eth_sendTransaction: resolveDispute(tenderId, upheld, notes)
        alt Dispute Upheld (Irregularity Found)
            SmartContract->>SmartContract: Reset winner = 0x0; status = UnderEvaluation; credit bond refund
            SmartContract-->>CVC: Emit DisputeResolved(tenderId, true, notes)
        else Dispute Dismissed (Baseless / Frivolous)
            SmartContract->>Treasury: Transfer dispute bond to treasuryAddress
            SmartContract->>SmartContract: Transition status = Awarded; restart/resume standstill
            SmartContract-->>CVC: Emit DisputeResolved(tenderId, false, notes)
        end
    else Standstill Expires Cleanly (No Active Dispute)
        Note over Keeper,SmartContract: Standstill period of 7 days lapses without dispute
    end

    Note over Keeper,Vendor: Phase 4: Finalization & Pull Payment Refunds
    Keeper->>SmartContract: eth_sendTransaction: finalizeTender(tenderId)
    SmartContract->>SmartContract: Verify: status == Awarded, now >= awardTimestamp + 7 days, no pending disputes
    SmartContract->>SmartContract: Transition status = Finalized
    SmartContract->>SmartContract: Call _creditRefunds(): credit EMDs of all valid bidders & winner to pendingWithdrawals
    SmartContract-->>Keeper: Emit TenderFinalized(tenderId)
    Vendor->>SmartContract: eth_sendTransaction: withdraw()
    SmartContract->>SmartContract: Transfer pending balance to Vendor via call{value: balance}("")
    SmartContract-->>Vendor: Emit WithdrawalSuccessful(vendor, balance)
